{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "651e29fb-4d20-8701-b2d9-cd3cdbad5b92",
  "created_at": "2025-12-20T11:33:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Luis Pacheco",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:29:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:29:46-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, good morning. Let me explain why I'm calling. I know it's Saturday and City Hall is closed, so I called the storm number they gave on the recording. I hope that's the right one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:30:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's the right place. We pick this line up on weekends. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:30:09-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So the storm that ended Thursday, the long rainy one, two days ago now. There's a catch basin at the corner by my house, and it's packed with leaves. Totally clogged. When the rain was coming down, the water couldn't go anywhere, so it backed up and ran right into my driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:30:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, catch basin at the corner, clogged with leaves, water backing into the driveway. Let me get that down. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:30:42-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "434 Ruggles Avenue. That's up on the Hill. The basin is right at the corner, maybe fifty feet down from my driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:30:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 434 Ruggles. Is there still standing water there now, or has it drained off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:31:00-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's gone down some, but there's still a puddle at the grate, and the leaves are just sitting on top of it. If we get more rain, it's going to do the same thing. And I'll tell you, it was not this bad last winter. We had rain then, plenty of it, and the water went down the drain fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:31:25-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, sounds like the leaves came down heavy this year and nobody's cleared it yet. Hang on, I'm writing this up. Basin at the corner, leaf blockage, water into the driveway, worse than last year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:31:40-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Sorry, one second, I've got pots going here. I'm cooking dinner for six relatives, they're all coming at one, so I'm running back and forth to the stove."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:31:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. I'll need a callback number in case dispatch wants to confirm the spot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:32:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0175."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:32:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0175. Got it. And are you the owner there, or renting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:32:08-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I rent. But the landlord isn't going to clean a city drain, so I figured I'd better call you. Who do I call to get it checked in the future, if it happens again? Is it this number every time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:32:25-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This number on weekends and evenings, and Public Works during the week. Same thing, just tell them it's a catch basin and give the street. I'll put this in as a request for a crew to look at the basin and clear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:32:44-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And do you know when somebody might come? Because the leaves have been there since November, honestly. I should have called sooner, but I figured the city would get to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:32:58-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd say sometime early next week is realistic, Monday or Tuesday if they're caught up. Weekend crews are mostly on emergencies. If the water starts coming toward the house, call back right away and I'll flag it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:33:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'd just like it done before the next storm. That's all I'm asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:33:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. It's in the system now. Anything else going on over there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:33:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. The driveway's the main thing. Thank you, Kevin. I've got to get back to the pots."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:33:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go on, don't burn anything. Enjoy the dinner."
    }
  ],
